After we remove the rp(echo 1 > /sys/devices/pci0000:00/0000:00:00.0/remove).
irq 23-29 are free, but the number of irqs does not have 32 (23-29 ) .
After we rescan the rp (echo 1 > /sys/bus/pci/rescan)
